  "notes": [
    "Mucho gusto is the safe, everyday \"nice to meet you\". Encantado (said by a man) and encantada (said by a woman) also work.",
    "Buenos días is for the morning. After noon it is buenas tardes, and after dark buenas noches. Colombians often just say ¡Buenas!",
    "Igualmente means \"likewise\": the usual answer to mucho gusto."
